Changes:
 grub-btrfsd (19.2.2) stable; urgency=low
 .
   * fix: Update package suggestions in debian/control for grub-btrfsd
   * fix: Update manpage paths in grub-btrfsd-man.manpages and enhance install rules in debian/rules
   * chore: Add Makefile for building and installing documentation and manual pages
   * fix: Update .gitignore to include grub-btrfsd-docs and grub-btrfsd-man directories, and correct manpage installation command
   * fix: Correct CHANGELOG_ITERATION value and add changelog line limit options
   * chore: Add documentation files list for grub-btrfsd
   * chore: Add manpage references and remove obsolete installmanpage file
   * fix: Update build dependencies and add documentation packages for grub-btrfsd
   * fix: Improve boot UUID subvolume detection logic
